{"a":[51,52],"h":"<p>O suretle 51.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"79\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 79.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 30.7 30.7 39.0 39.0 48.0 54.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 48.0 54.7 63.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Semudu da helâk etti de <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"96\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 95.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.7 27.7 34.6 34.6 41.3 57.0 57.0 63.7 72.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"41.3 63.7 72.7 79.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> hiç bırakmadı - ya'ni ne Adden ne Semuddan iyman etmiyenlerin hiç birini bırakmadı, günahlarını cezasız yanlarına bırakmadı 52.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"159\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 158.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 27.0 27.0 33.7 49.4 49.4 60.0 60.0 75.7 88.4 96.7 96.7 112.4 119.3 119.3 127.4 134.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.7 75.7 112.4 127.4 134.3 142.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> daha evvel de Nuh kavmını helâk etmişti<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"234\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 233.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.7 27.7 34.4 34.4 45.0 51.7 69.0 78.0 84.7 84.7 95.3 111.0 111.0 120.0 120.0 138.0 144.7 153.0 153.0 159.7 166.4 186.7 186.7 195.7 195.7 204.0 204.0 210.7 210.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"45.0 51.7 69.0 78.0 95.3 166.4 204.0 217.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> çünki onlar daha zâlim ve daha azgın idiler, Nuh kavmı obirlerinden daha zâlim idiler, Hazreti Nuha pek çok eza ediyorlardı. </p>"}